<title>SPAIN: Spain's Rato to meet Tietmeyer this Thursday RTR.</title>
<headline>Spain's Rato to meet Tietmeyer this Thursday RTR.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato will meet Bundesbank's president Hans Tietmeyer on Thursday afternoon in Frankfurt, the Spanish Ministry said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The same day at 0800 GMT Rato will give his testimony at the Economic Commission of the European Parliament in Strasbourg. His speech will be followed by a new conference at 1000 GMT.</p>
<p>At 1330 GMT he is scheduled to meet Tietmeyer in Frankfurt.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
